# Icons

Use `lucide-react` for new icons. Import the glyph from `lucide-react` and render it with `Icon` from `src/components/ui/icon.tsx` so size (18) and stroke (1.5) stay consistent.

```tsx
import { FileText } from "lucide-react";
import { Icon } from "../components/ui/icon.tsx";

<Icon icon={FileText} />
```

Do not add another icon package. Do not inline a new SVG when Lucide already has the mark.
